;; Tools, integrations, and optional runtime extension.
(:title
 ("Adapt Autolith for " (:em nil "your work."))
 :lede
 ("Use the tools already in Autolith, connect the software you rely on, or ask the agent to add a capability. Configure it in files or extend the live runtime from the prompt by asking the agent.")
 :skills
 ("Load task-specific instructions from standard SKILL.md files or native SKILL.sexp skills. Executable skills can package Lisp workflows that extend the agent's capabilities.")
 :mcp
 ("Connect external tools and resources over stdio or Streamable HTTP, with per-server approval policies.")
 :editors
 ("Use Autolith from an editor through the Agent Client Protocol with " (:code nil "autolith acp") ". Stream answers, tool activity, approvals, and steering into the same session."))
